's why we  see those labor shortages in sectors  such as manufacturing or tourism  hospitality especially in the last two  years obviously there were shortages  prior to covet 19. now as we are  emerging a little bit from the pandemic  you get new shortages where workforce  might have left on mass because those  sectors were closed we were struggling  for a while because a lot of employees  wanted to change  completely the industry  and this is where we again we turn to  employment services they support us with  on-the-job training we can hire  young people making them trained  employees when they start most of the  people trained through the on-the-job  training got employed in these sectors  at latest one year after the job  training helped me to start a  professional career in the hotel as a  trainee and after that i got a full-time  job i'm planning to finish my faculty of  economics  department marketing  and maybe  i will work with the marketing team here  in the hotel i hope so  i think by working with other  stakeholders you can  draw on their experience and knowledge  and their additional data as well in  order to build a better package of  measures that actually helps to  integrate someone into work
 

